# The article that opens a weekday: "o luns", "quedamos o venres", and the
# habitual "os luns".  "E obrigatorio se van en plural ou se quere precisar o
# dia: Os luns estudio. Quedamos o venres." (EOI Lugo, "O artigo", D) Usos do
# artigo determinado, p. 3).  A habitual phrase reads as the next such day
# (ruling 5 of 2026-11-12 in
# knowledge/wiki/audits/chronologia/disagreement-classes.md).
o
os
